o Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQXzlVU3ZWLTFMLVFpcUtVMXFqc1FsUW9vcTVrVHh2XzVCUUx2ajI4cENnc3lGMlVJSnVUU2xkczlNTzZ2LVBxcnVBRjdJVVFHZ0NEbGMyd3ltdnNHcklCdUhNWFN6WU1DdFRnUjhXQVJGVFU1MjVzNDBsS1ROMFI4YVQwUUVpY3FWMFViM3poUUFOay1vdXJiUnZRVS0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Coinbase Global 下跌 53% 受挫？熊看到了什麼"},{"title":"[Coinbase Global Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Prediction Markets Hit $200M Run Rate as Coinbase Offsets 10% Spot Volume Decline, Revenue Flat QoQ","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1CSUFBTkU0ZFVvLU9ETXRFUi1jZ1Y3QUtDYkRULUMwam1rNWpRMWJwa2FRQlB6OWw3ZFVXUFJiS1FQX3h5TGtWV1VYNnM0RDVKYzF3RkZmUXFvM0ZXbXc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[Coinbase 全球 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] 預測市場運作率將達到 2 億美元，Coinbase 抵銷了 10% 的現貨交易量下降，營收季持平"},{"title":"Coinbase Global Earnings Will Show If It Can Move Past Lackluster Crypto Market","src":"Barron's","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOUUN1TkxuRFZBdFM2aWU0emVkRm12WElZWTFiUHBhVTNpWlhia2RNaWpWd1VBNXktcmxtYTIyWHN5WnMyQ2lPbmN1bDRvU0JXWmN2eloyQVdvRF9mNm5McVJ1Mm5Jb3NPcHkzYWh5dlBDWk1KRmNZMFg5VGZNY3E1U0hCdkdobDM1Z3pXeUVMeDFJemV2YUF3dm5zTHJ5eGNkd0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Coinbase 全球收益將顯示它能否擺脫暗淡的加密貨幣市場"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":10},{"name":"加密貨幣","count":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1679788/000167978826000015/coin-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are working to update the century-old financial system by providing a trusted platform that makes it easy for our customers to engage with crypto assets. In December 2025, we took a major step forward to becoming the Everything Exchange—dramatically expanding the assets available to trade on Coinbase, including stocks, commodity futures, perpetual futures, and prediction markets. Our goal is to create a comprehensive, seamless experience for retail users, institutions, and developers to engage in the future of finance.","zh":"我們正在努力透過提供一個值得信賴的平台來更新具有百年歷史的金融體系，使我們的客戶可以輕鬆使用加密資產。 2025 年 12 月，我們向成為一切交易所邁出了重要一步——大幅擴展了 Coinbase 上可交易的資產，包括股票、商品期貨、永續期貨和預測市場。我們的目標是為零售用戶、機構和開發商創造全面、無縫的體驗，以參與金融的未來。"},{"en":"Consumers: Retail customers seeking to hold, invest or trade crypto assets, as well as a growing set of trading offerings such as equities, prediction markets, and derivatives. Consumers use Coinbase as a primary account for crypto-enabled financial services, and to engage onchain.","zh":"消費者：尋求持有、投資或交易加密資產以及股票、預測市場和衍生性商品等不斷成長的交易產品的零售客戶。消費者使用 Coinbase 作為加密金融服務的主要帳戶，並參與鏈上活動。"},{"en":"Institutions: Businesses including market makers, asset managers, hedge funds, banks, wealth platforms, registered investment advisors, payment platforms, and public and private corporations. These customers use our products to custody and trade crypto or crypto derivatives.","zh":"機構：包括做市商、資產管理公司、對沖基金、銀行、財富平台、註冊投資顧問、支付平台、公共和私人公司在內的企業。這些客戶使用我們的產品來託管和交易加密貨幣或加密貨幣衍生性商品。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We provide an onchain staking service, which allows our customers to stake their assets with a few clicks. Our customers maintain full ownership of their crypto assets while earning staking rewards. Customers who stake their assets receive rewards, paid out by applicable blockchain protocols, in the form of the network's crypto asset. The rewards rates, expressed as an annual percentage yield, vary by asset. In return for the services we provide, we earn a fixed percentage commission on all staking rewards received.","zh":"我們提供鏈上質押服務，讓我們的客戶只需點擊幾下即可質押他們的資產。我們的客戶在獲得質押獎勵的同時，保持對其加密資產的完全所有權。質押其資產的客戶會收到獎勵，該獎勵透過適用的區塊鏈協議以網路加密資產的形式支付。獎勵率以年收益率百分比表示，因資產而異。作為我們提供服務的回報，我們會根據收到的所有質押獎勵賺取固定百分比的佣金。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The crypto industry is highly innovative, rapidly evolving, and characterized by healthy competition, experimentation, changing customer needs, frequent introductions of new products and services, and is subject to uncertain and evolving industry and regulatory requirements. We face significant competition from a variety of companies around the world—ranging from crypto-native companies, including decentralized exchanges, to large traditional financial services incumbents and financial technology providers.","zh":"加密產業高度創新、快速發展，其特點是良性競爭、實驗、不斷變化的客戶需求、頻繁推出新產品和服務，並受到不確定和不斷變化的行業和監管要求的影響。我們面臨來自世界各地各種公司的激烈競爭——從加密貨幣本土公司（包括去中心化交易所）到大型傳統金融服務企業和金融技術提供商。"},{"en":"traditional financial services and financial technology companies. This includes companies that offer crypto powered products, as well as companies that only offer traditional products, such as stocks. With the expansion in our product offerings in 2025 to include stocks, prediction markets and more, our competitive set in this category has broadened;","zh":"傳統金融服務和金融科技公司。這包括提供加密產品的公司，以及僅提供股票等傳統產品的公司。隨著 2025 年我們的產品範圍擴大到包括股票、預測市場等，我們在這一類別中的競爭範圍也擴大了；"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Bank Servicing & Subscription & Circulation","val":6883438000,"zh":"銀行服務、認購及流通"},{"name":"Bank Servicing","val":4055390000,"zh":"銀行服務"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Consumer Net","val":3322835000,"zh":"銀行服務消費者網"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":2828048000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Stablecoin","val":1348821000,"zh":"訂閱及流通穩定幣"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Blockchain Infrastructure Service","val":677405000,"zh":"訂閱流通區塊鏈基礎設施服務"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Other","val":554775000,"zh":"認購流通其他"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Institutional","val":479667000,"zh":"銀行服務機構"},{"name":"Other Revenue","val":297887000,"zh":"其他收入"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Other","val":252888000,"zh":"銀行服務其他"}],"total":7181325000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6010607000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1170718000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":7181325000}},"peers":["HOOD","MSTR","PLTR","RBLX","SOFI"]}}